# test qualifiers

Programma arassala.

>> Fruit := Obýekt täze.
Fruit gelende: ['täze'] et: {
	>> f := özi täze.
	f apples: 0. <- f.
}.
Fruit gelende: ['apples:'] et: { :a öz apples := a. }.
Fruit gelende: ['apples'] et: { <- öz apples. }.
Fruit gelende: ['+'] et: { :f
	>> n := Fruit täze.
	n apples: (f apples + öz apples). <- n.
}.
San gelende: ['apples'] et: { <- ((Fruit täze) apples: özi).
}.

Fruit gelende: ['tekst'] et: { <- öz apples + [' apples '].
}.

>> q := 3 apples + 4 apples.
Çykyş ýaz: q, täze-setir.




q := 3 apples + 4 apples.
